BT /F2 17 Tf 56 736 Td (Welcome and quick start) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 702 Td 15 TL
(Thank you for choosing the Acme AirLink X200. This guide explains how to set up your router,) Tj T*
(what the lights mean, how to keep your network secure and what to do if something goes) Tj T*
(wrong.) Tj T*
T*
(What is in the box: the AirLink X200 router, a 12 V power adapter, one yellow Ethernet) Tj T*
(cable, a quick start card and a wall-mount bracket with two screws.) Tj T*
T*
(Quick start. 1. Place the router in an open area, away from microwave ovens and thick walls.) Tj T*
(2. Connect the yellow Ethernet cable from your modem to the yellow WAN port on the back of) Tj T*
(the router. 3. Plug in the power adapter and wait about two minutes while the Power light) Tj T*
(blinks amber. 4. When the Power light turns solid green, join the Wi-Fi network printed on) Tj T*
(the label under the router. 5. Open the AirLink app or visit airlink.setup in a web browser) Tj T*
(and follow the steps to name your network and choose a password. 6. Restart your devices so) Tj T*
(they reconnect.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 40 Td (Acme AirLink X200 Wi-Fi Router: User Guide \(sample document\)  -  Page 1 of 6) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
