stream
BT /F2 17 Tf 56 736 Td (Wi-Fi and security) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 702 Td 15 TL
(Network name and password. The default network name and password are printed on the label) Tj T*
(under the router. Change both during setup. A good password has at least 12 characters.) Tj T*
T*
(Guest network. In the AirLink app choose Guest network and switch it on. You can set it to) Tj T*
(turn off automatically after 24 hours.) Tj T*
T*
(WPS pairing. Press and hold the WPS button on the side of the router for 3 seconds. The Wi-) Tj T*
(Fi light blinks blue for two minutes while you press the WPS button on the device you want) Tj T*
(to connect.) Tj T*
T*
(Parental controls. In the app choose Family, then add each child's devices to a profile. You) Tj T*
(can block categories of websites and set a daily internet schedule.) Tj T*
T*
(Band steering. The router combines the 2.4 GHz and 5 GHz networks under one name and moves) Tj T*
(each device to the faster band when it can. Turn this off in Advanced settings if an older) Tj T*
(device will not connect.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 40 Td (Acme AirLink X200 Wi-Fi Router: User Guide \(sample document\)  -  Page 3 of 6) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
