stream
BT /F2 17 Tf 56 736 Td (Resetting and updating) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 702 Td 15 TL
(Restart. To restart the router, unplug the power adapter for 10 seconds and plug it back in.) Tj T*
(Your settings are kept.) Tj T*
T*
(Factory reset. To erase all settings and return to the defaults, use a paperclip to press) Tj T*
(and hold the Reset button on the back for 10 seconds, until the Power light blinks red.) Tj T*
(Release the button and wait three minutes. After a factory reset you must set up the router) Tj T*
(again.) Tj T*
T*
(Firmware updates. The router checks for updates every night and installs them between 3 a.m.) Tj T*
(and 4 a.m. To update by hand, open the AirLink app, choose Settings, then Firmware, and tap) Tj T*
(Update now. Never unplug the router while it is updating: the Power light blinks white) Tj T*
(during an update.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 40 Td (Acme AirLink X200 Wi-Fi Router: User Guide \(sample document\)  -  Page 4 of 6) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
