BT /F2 17 Tf 56 736 Td (Specifications, warranty and safety) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 702 Td 15 TL
(Specifications. Wi-Fi: dual band 2.4 GHz and 5 GHz. Ports: one WAN port and four 1 Gigabit) Tj T*
(LAN ports. Power: 12 V, 1.5 A. Size: 160 mm by 160 mm by 45 mm. Weight: 380 grams.) Tj T*
T*
(Warranty. Acme provides a two-year limited warranty from the date of purchase. The warranty) Tj T*
(covers defects in materials and workmanship. It does not cover damage from liquids,) Tj T*
(overheating caused by blocking the vents, or modification of the router.) Tj T*
T*
(Safety. Use only the supplied power adapter. Keep the router away from water and do not) Tj T*
(cover its vents. Do not open the case: there are no user-serviceable parts inside. Recycle) Tj T*
(the router and adapter at an electronics collection point rather than throwing them in) Tj T*
(household waste.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 56 40 Td (Acme AirLink X200 Wi-Fi Router: User Guide \(sample document\)  -  Page 6 of 6) Tj ET
endstream
